              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "5.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a people dedicated to me alone, and you will serve me as priests.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Moses went down and called the leaders of the people together and told them everything that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then all the people answered together, “We will do everything that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has said,” and Moses reported this to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
