        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “I will come to you in a thick cloud, so that the people will hear me speaking with you and will believe you from now on.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses told the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " what the people had answered, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to him, “Go to the people and tell them to spend today and tomorrow purifying themselves for worship. They must wash their clothes ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and be ready the day after tomorrow. On that day I will come down on Mount Sinai, where all the people can see me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.18+HEB.12.19+HEB.12.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 12.18–20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mark a boundary round the mountain that the people must not cross, and tell them not to go up the mountain or even get near it. If anyone sets foot on it, he is to be put to death; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he must either be stoned or shot with arrows, without anyone touching him. This applies to both men and animals; they must be put to death. But when the trumpet is blown, then the people are to go up to the mountain.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Moses came down the mountain and told the people to get ready for worship. So they washed their clothes, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Moses said to them, “Be ready by the day after tomorrow and don't have sexual intercourse in the meantime.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
