            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.4.11+DEU.4.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 4.11–12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the morning of the third day there was thunder and lightning, a thick cloud appeared on the mountain, and a very loud trumpet blast was heard. All the people in the camp trembled with fear. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses led them out of the camp to meet God, and they stood at the foot of the mountain. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The whole of Mount Sinai was covered with smoke, because the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had come down on it in fire. The smoke went up like the smoke of a furnace, and all the people trembled violently. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sound of the trumpet became louder and louder. Moses spoke, and God answered him with thunder. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " came down on the top of Mount Sinai and called Moses to the top of the mountain. Moses went up ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to him, “Go down and warn the people not to cross the boundary to come and look at me; if they do, many of them will die. ",
          "type": "text",
